    "description": "Weds Co., Ltd., together with its subsidiaries, engages in the planning, development, and sale of automotive parts and accessories in Japan. It operates through Automobile Related Sales Business, Logistics Business, Automotive Retail Business, and Welfare segments. The company is involved in the wholesale business, including after-sales service of automobile parts, automobile wheels, and car accessory parts; manufacture of steel wheels; sale of automobile wheel parts; manufacture and sale of high-end aluminum wheels; logistics business, such as storage and loading of wheels and other original products; wheels and car accessory parts retail business; and operation as a real estate rental company. It also provides warehousing services, as well as welfare services for the elderly. The company was formerly known as Nippo Co., Ltd. and changed its name to Weds Co., Ltd. in November 1973. Weds Co., Ltd. was founded in 1965 and is headquartered in Tokyo, Japan."
